{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35232","headline":"筑城篇 · 顾云","name":"筑城篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十六里西川地，围遶城郭峨天横。\n一家人率一口甓，版筑才兴城已成。\n役夫登登无倦色，馔饱觞酣方暂息。\n不假神龟出指踪，尽凭心匠爲筹画。\n画阁团团真铁瓮，堵阔巉岩齐石壁。\n风吹四面旌旗动，火焰相烧满天赤。\n散花楼晚挂残虹，濯锦秋江澄倒碧。\n西川父老贺子孙，从兹始是中华人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35232.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35232","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}